{"seq":4,"slug":"veterinary","title":"兽医学","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"兽医学-简介\">兽医学 简介</h1><p>兽医学研究的是动物的健康与疾病——从如何让一头奶牛保持高产、一只宠物犬安度晚年，到如何在禽流感暴发时守住整个养殖场乃至公共卫生防线。它既是一门关于生命的基础科学，也是一门高度实践的临床技艺。与人类医学不同，兽医面对的&quot;病人&quot;种类极其庞杂：犬猫、牛羊猪鸡、马、鱼类、蜜蜂，乃至动物园里的大象和长颈鹿，每一类都有独特的解剖结构、生理特点和疾病谱。</p>\n<p>这门学科的重要性远超&quot;给小动物看病&quot;的直观印象。全球约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span> 的人类传染病源自动物（即&quot;人畜共患病&quot;，如狂犬病、布鲁氏菌病、新冠肺炎的可能源头），兽医因此站在公共卫生的第一道防线上。同时，畜牧业为全球数十亿人提供蛋白质，动物疾病一次大规模暴发（如非洲猪瘟在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2018</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2018</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2018</span></span></span></span></span> 年导致中国生猪存栏量骤减约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span></span></span></span></span>）就能撼动一国的食品供应与物价。&quot;同一健康&quot;（One Health）理念正是把人、动物与环境的健康视为不可分割的整体。</p>\n<p>本学习空间将兽医学的核心领域组织为四个章节。<strong>第一章 动物解剖与生理基础</strong> 建立认识动物身体的地图，理解器官系统如何协同工作，这是一切诊疗的根基。<strong>第二章 动物病理与微生物学</strong> 探讨疾病如何发生、病原体（细菌、病毒、寄生虫）如何致病，以及免疫系统如何防御。<strong>第三章 兽医临床诊疗</strong> 进入实战环节，涵盖临床检查、影像与实验室诊断、内外科治疗与麻醉用药的基本逻辑。<strong>第四章 动物公共卫生与畜牧</strong> 把视野从单个动物拓展到群体，讨论传染病防控、食品安全、人畜共患病与现代养殖管理。</p>\n<p>学习兽医学最有效的方式是&quot;由结构到功能、由正常到异常、由个体到群体&quot;的递进。建议每学一个概念时，都尝试把它落到一个具体物种和真实场景上——比如理解了反刍胃的结构，就去想象一头患瘤胃酸中毒的奶牛会出现什么症状。理论与临床案例的反复对照，是把书本知识转化为诊断直觉的唯一路径。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"anatomy-physiology","title":"第一章 动物解剖与生理基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/anatomy-physiology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"musculoskeletal-system","title":"大学兽医学 — 骨骼肌肉与体表方位","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/anatomy-physiology/musculoskeletal-system"},{"seq":2,"slug":"digestive-system","title":"大学兽医学 — 消化系统与反刍生理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/anatomy-physiology/digestive-system"},{"seq":3,"slug":"circulatory-respiratory","title":"大学兽医学 — 循环与呼吸系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/anatomy-physiology/circulatory-respiratory"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"pathology-microbiology","title":"第二章 动物病理与微生物学","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/pathology-microbiology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"pathology-basics","title":"大学兽医学 — 病理学基本概念","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/pathology-microbiology/pathology-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pathogens","title":"大学兽医学 — 病原微生物与寄生虫","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/pathology-microbiology/pathogens"},{"seq":3,"slug":"immunology-vaccines","title":"大学兽医学 — 免疫系统与疫苗","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/pathology-microbiology/immunology-vaccines"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"clinical-practice","title":"第三章 兽医临床诊疗","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/clinical-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"clinical-examination-diagnosis","title":"大学兽医学 — 临床检查与诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/clinical-practice/clinical-examination-diagnosis"},{"seq":2,"slug":"medical-surgical-treatment","title":"大学兽医学 — 内科与外科治疗","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/clinical-practice/medical-surgical-treatment"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anesthesia-pharmacology","title":"大学兽医学 — 麻醉与兽医药理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/clinical-practice/anesthesia-pharmacology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"public-health-husbandry","title":"第四章 动物公共卫生与畜牧","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/public-health-husbandry","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"zoonoses-disease-control","title":"大学兽医学 — 人畜共患病与传染病防控","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/public-health-husbandry/zoonoses-disease-control"},{"seq":2,"slug":"food-safety-husbandry","title":"大学兽医学 — 食品安全与现代畜牧","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/agriculture/veterinary/public-health-husbandry/food-safety-husbandry"}]}]}